@startuml
' SET09803 DevOps Coursework - Requirement 29 Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Data Researcher" as Researcher
rectangle "Database System" as DB << System >>

rectangle "World Population Reporting System" {
    usecase "Retrieve Country Population" as UC_CountryPopulation
    usecase "Validate Country" as UC_ValidateCountry
    usecase "Query Country Population Data" as UC_QueryCountry
    usecase "Display Error Message" as UC_Error
}

' Primary Actor Interactions
Researcher --> UC_CountryPopulation

' Sub-task dependencies (Includes)
UC_CountryPopulation .> UC_ValidateCountry : <<include>>
UC_CountryPopulation .> UC_QueryCountry : <<include>>

' System Actor Interactions
UC_QueryCountry --> DB

' Failure Extension
UC_CountryPopulation <.. UC_Error : <<extend>>\n(Invalid Country or\nDatabase Failure)

' Notes
note right of UC_CountryPopulation
  Retrieves the population
  of a selected country for
  national population analysis
end note

note right of UC_QueryCountry
  Queries the population value
  for the selected country
  from the database
end note

note bottom of UC_Error
  Triggered if the country
  is invalid, MySQL database
  is unreachable, or required
  population data is missing
end note

@enduml